Read(<a> hi </a>) events: Start(a) Value[ hi ] End(a)
Read(<a>x\ny</a>) events: Start(a) Value[x\ny] End(a)
Read(<a>x\ty</a>) events: Start(a) Value[x\ty] End(a)
Read(<a>x\r\ny</a>) events: Start(a) Value[x\ny] End(a)
Read(<a>x\ry</a>) events: Start(a) Value[x\ny] End(a)
Read(<a>two  spaces</a>) events: Start(a) Value[two  spaces] End(a)
Read(<a> <b>x</b></a>) events: Start(a) Start(b) Value[x] End(b) End(a)
Read(<a>\n\t<b>x</b>\n</a>) events: Start(a) Start(b) Value[x] End(b) End(a)
Read(\n<a>t</a>\n) events: Start(a) Value[t] End(a)
Read(<a >t</a >) events: Start(a) Value[t] End(a)
